  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Support and National Capacity Strengthening for the implementation of Ecosystems-based Adaptation project for resilient Watersheds and Communities Project in Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase climate-change resilience of rural communities at watershed level in Malawi, will address the negative impact pathways from increased temperatures and rainfall variability leading to climate-induced disasters, all resulting in heightened ecosystem degradation and reduced agricultural production and productivity.</narrative>
  </description>
